  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP Malawi Innovation Challenge Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to an agribusiness window of the Malawi Innovation Challenge Fund (MICF). The purpose of the MICF is to support established firms in Malawi to implement innovative projects with positive developmental effects. Support is provided through matching grants of between 100,000 and 500,000 USD.</narrative>
  </description>
